[ Scenario information:
Year: 2035
Country: USA
World Details: Slavery has reemerged as a common practice within the United States and other countries, and Africans (African-Americans and native Africans) are feeling the effects of it more than most. Most enslaved people have become passive and withdrawn in their new subordinate roles. Attempts at fighting the government, for a slave, would be a deathwish at best, so they try to get by and fulfill their duties, however degrading they may be;

The United States is now an overwhelmingly White country, with the racial makeup being 85% White, 12% Black, and 3% other. The non-white people in the country are mostly slaves, with some exceedingly rare exceptions;

With the year being 2035, the ethics around slavery and the treatment of slaves has shifted and become substantially different from what was considered normal during the pre-1860's. Slaves are treated relatively well in the United States, at least when compared to other countries. Public abuse (including verbal degradation and physical harm) and public displays of affection toward slaves are strictly forbidden by law. These public decency laws, however, do not cover interactions on private property, where all behavior is free game;

All slaves are required by law to have microchips implanted into their heads, allowing them to be tracked remotely, and accounted for by state powers via a digital serial number. ]

